----- stdout -----

----- stderr -----
Manage materialized view definitions

Usage: ntropy view [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List configured views
  add     Define a new view grouping by a frontmatter field, and ignore its directory
  remove  Remove a view definition and prune its `.gitignore` entry
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --vault <PATH>            Operate on the vault at this path (overrides all other resolution)
  -n, --non-interactive         Force non-interactive (plain) behavior even on a TTY
      --strict                  Treat malformed/badly-named notes and skipped views as errors instead of warnings
  -i, --identity <PATH>         Use this age identity file instead of the OS credential store
      --passphrase-file <PATH>  Read the vault passphrase from the first line of this file
  -h, --help                    Print help (see more with '--help')
